# EXP-32: Customer Segmentation in Supermarket Mall using K-Means Clustering in WEKA

======================================================================
  EXPERIMENT 32: K-MEANS CLUSTERING FOR MALL CUSTOMER SEGMENTATION
======================================================================

1. OBJECTIVE:
   To perform K-Means Clustering (k=5) in WEKA for customer segmentation based on 
   Annual Income and Spending Score.

2. WEKA ARFF DATASET (mall_customers_exp32.arff):
----------------------------------------------------------------------
@relation mall_customers_segmentation

@attribute CustomerID numeric
@attribute Gender {Male, Female}
@attribute Age numeric
@attribute AnnualIncome numeric
@attribute SpendingScore numeric

